summary.label:
Brush Master is a small puzzle casual game. The picky owner has arranged a strict painting plan for you, and you need to arrange for the painting workers to paint in a certain order. Get the color of your paint to match the owner's arrangement and you've got yourself a winner. Any discrepancies and the owner will put you back to work.



How to play:

1. Observe the schematic diagram given by the owner;

2. Determine the order of painting in your mind;

3. Click on the painter to work;

4. Clicking on the second painter will cover the superimposed part;

5. After all the painting workers have completed their work and are consistent with the schematic diagram, they will win the game;



Game Features:

1. Rich and interesting level patterns;

2. Casual and educational gameplay;

3. Completely free 2D game;

4. Exercise your IQ.



Welcome to try our game, if you have any comments on the game, you can give feedback in the game, thank you for your participation.
